{"4225370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The lost trail", "steam_appid": 4225370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, a young boy rescued a raccoon from the hands of poachers. But one day, the boy disappeared — and now the raccoon is left alone in a vast, beautiful, yet unforgiving world. <br>You play as that raccoon, guided by memories, scents, and instinct. Your journey will lead you through dense forests, abandoned hunting camps, shadowy streams, and open fields where every noise can be either a clue… or a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you’ll encounter old traps left behind by poachers, flee from danger, search for shelter, follow tracks, and uncover small mysteries of the wilderness. And the deeper you venture, the clearer it becomes: this is not just a story about searching for a boy. It’s a story about trust, freedom, survival, and the fragile bond that can form between a human and a wild creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Survive. Remember. And find the one who once saved your life.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, a young boy rescued a raccoon from the hands of poachers. But one day, the boy disappeared — and now the raccoon is left alone in a vast, beautiful, yet unforgiving world. <br>You play as that raccoon, guided by memories, scents, and instinct. Your journey will lead you through dense forests, abandoned hunting camps, shadowy streams, and open fields where every noise can be either a clue… or a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you’ll encounter old traps left behind by poachers, flee from danger, search for shelter, follow tracks, and uncover small mysteries of the wilderness. And the deeper you venture, the clearer it becomes: this is not just a story about searching for a boy. It’s a story about trust, freedom, survival, and the fragile bond that can form between a human and a wild creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Survive. Remember. And find the one who once saved your life.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Play as a raccoon on a heartfelt and dangerous journey to find the boy who once saved you from poachers. Explore the wild, avoid traps, uncover secrets, and experience a story of friendship, survival, and hope.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225370/3599ce2d76eb25f64ccb3ab11cc9fe9ebd84b08f/header.jpg?t=1786993306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225370/e877fc376d5437fe7d975c1aa9f68180ee0445ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786993306", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225370/e877fc376d5437fe7d975c1aa9f68180ee0445ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786993306", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3470 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960, 4 GB or AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-7700K or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": 